+## Current bounded learnability finding
+
+On generator source `902647fd77298a9bb8fbccbb38926dc435fd0dd2d4f7753c365228d3286abcde`
+(version 3.1.0), selected canonical rule `d42370107d4a`, an ordinary consecutive
